{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026wJQzq4Ak4I1792745979.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>節目《女神配對計劃2》今（25日）集繼續進行單對單的「心跳電話亭」環節。Ice（俞鋆瑞）與 Preston（伍頌曦）毫無懸念地再度同時選擇郭珮文（Juliana），二人均各自精心準備了禮物，試圖博取女神歡心，以爭取與她進一步互動的機會。</p><p></p><p></p><p>期間，Ice 以超大陣仗浪漫登場，一口氣準備了三紮代表不同寓意的玫瑰花，震撼現場眾人。嘉賓雲文子師傅見狀忍不住當場調侃笑問：「求婚呀？」，而身旁的的葉蒨文亦驚訝得「O晒嘴」。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"3a33f825-0227-4863-af14-451bb645fa79.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026SyW5LZFofb1792745979.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>另一方面，勁敵 Preston 的實力同樣不容小覷。當 Juliana 打開 Preston 準備的兩份禮物後，即時露出極度驚喜的笑容，更激讚對方十分細心，大讚：「冇諗過佢係咁了解我，送嘅所有嘢都非常鍾意！」</p><p></p><p>眼見 Preston 送出的禮物精準擊中女神心意，Ice 在接受採訪時坦言倍感「威脅」及緊張，並直言：「看到這個禮物，我知道 Juliana 一定很喜歡，我有點擔心她可能不選我。」</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"262c10f8-cd78-4715-9f90-729526cba345.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Jwc1llc3M21792745979.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:40.478527+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":402,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T11:51:09.377007+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:38:48.760798+00:00","content_hash":"37528bcc2b2878d8cae208eb1f6965e2ae3fde42bc3295928a06f8190960ea7e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:40.478527+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}